# Trivy ignore list for the container-image scan in CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml).
# Every entry needs a reason and an expiry; the scan fails again the day one lapses.
#
# CVE-2026-31789 — libssl3 heap buffer overflow when parsing a large X.509 certificate,
# on 32-bit builds only. Both runtime images are built and deployed as linux/amd64
# (ci.yml / deploy.yml pin the platform), so the affected code path is not reachable.
# Fixed in openssl 3.0.19-1~deb12u2; remove this line once
# gcr.io/distroless/nodejs24-debian12:nonroot ships it (trivy image <ref> shows the version).
CVE-2026-31789 exp:2026-09-30
